Z||000000||jerpro||01-09-2001||04:29 PM||||Gm was planning on putting a 4.1 v6 in the 89 fiero's. Does anyone know if any cars have these motors?<BR>ANy kits?<BR>ANyone have experience with these motors? <BR>thanks.<BR>I want to stay v6. I don't care (yet) for v8's.<BR>thanks.<P>------------------<BR>Only try your best, and if you don't succeed... TRY HARDER.||||reg||1
Z||000001||loafer87gt||01-09-2001||05:06 PM||||As far as I know, GM was planning on using the 3.4 DOHC engine in the 89 GT's. The only 4.1 I know of is the caddy V8 engine. I think you might be thinking of the 4.3 V6, found in newer Chev's. I saw a guys page (I think some Brad guy) a while back and he mistakenly said that that was the engine (4.3) was planned for the 89 Fieros. ||||reg||1
Z||000002||jerpro||01-09-2001||05:19 PM||||ohh....<BR>MAN! I wanted to stay v6! gr...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR>I was all happy there might be a 4.1 v6 out there... oh well... I'll have to stick to the norm... 3.4. <BR>If anyone knows of a bigger small block v6 please post it thanks.<BR>||||reg||1
